  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pyin-Nya-Man-Daing (PNMD) Programme (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower Myanmar&#x2019;s youth, academia and civil society from across the country by providing equitable and inclusive access to rights-based education, applied research, and digital knowledge platforms, enabling them to become informed change-makers who actively contribute to conflict transformation, justice, and peacebuilding in Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
